  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adapting the book collections of Ukraine to the conditions of the digital society</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Prisp&#xf4;sobenie kni&#x17e;n&#xfd;ch zbierok Ukrajiny podmienkam digit&#xe1;lnej spolo&#x10d;nosti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Cie&#x13e;om projektu je zdie&#x13e;anie sk&#xfa;senost&#xed; v oblasti zav&#xe1;dzania inovat&#xed;vnych kni&#x17e;ni&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch technol&#xf3;gi&#xed; do pr&#xe1;ce univerzitnej kni&#x17e;nice, ako aj z&#xed;skanie praktick&#xfd;ch vedomost&#xed; a zru&#x10d;nost&#xed; v r&#xe1;mci digitaliz&#xe1;cie.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to share experiences in the implementation of innovative library technologies into the work of a university library, as well as to acquire practical knowledge and skills within the scope of digitization.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
